itation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_15_x2c_4_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_3_x2c_29_x2c_6_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_4_x2c_4_x2c_4_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_4_x2c__x2d_28_x2c_3_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_6_x2c_3_x2c_4_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_7_x2c_1_x2c_7_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_PR_xc4__x80_T_x2e__x2d_4_x2c_41>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_PR_xc4__x80_T_x2e__x2d_6> ;
